    <item>
      <title>Version 0.2.1</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:41:40 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Denser inbox: two-line rows, quieter tags, and only the sender in bold when unread</li><li>Hover a conversation to reply, mark it read or archive it without opening it</li><li>Archive leads the reader toolbar (E); Reply is the one main button below</li><li>The brief card shows what&#x27;s waiting in numbers, and shrinks once you&#x27;ve read today&#x27;s brief</li><li>A proper inbox zero: you&#x27;re all caught up, with what&#x27;s next</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/pushrefresh/pushmail-releases/releases/download/v0.2.1/PushMail-0.2.1.zip" sparkle:edSignature="PXN3SfysLkO9m+lAC1Jxpxitcb+DXjqNf430heDiEw3F+k/CYvAYHGJG9npx10/pGB1JPgtWkc7QiEq36btMDA==" length="4878703" type="application/octet-stream"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 0.2.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:19:20 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>One unified inbox: every Gmail account plus Slack, GitHub and Notion in a single list, grouped by day</li><li>Newsletters, receipts and notifications fold into one expandable updates row per day</li><li>Chips above the list show one account or integration (⌘1–9); the Daily Brief is a card at the top</li><li>No more sidebar, tabs, star, snooze, labels or spam; Drafts, Sent, Trash and search are in ⌘K and cover every account</li><li>Anything you had snoozed is back in your inbox</li><li>Invites are answered from the account they arrived in</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/pushrefresh/pushmail-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0/PushMail-0.2.0.zip" sparkle:edSignature="LVOWpjh4PLsx425cj3TOkJgFBy7qD8t/l8bQKI8nUn0FJnPHrozlXTNbthMrSgYs7FAt+a06ldkJLZMZ94wTDA==" length="4835380" type="application/octet-stream"/>
    </item>
