      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Sign in with Slack and Notion from Settings › Integrations, no tokens needed</li><li>Notion asks which pages to share while you sign in, so there&#x27;s no separate sharing step</li><li>Pasting a token still works, under &quot;Use a token instead&quot;</li></ul>]]></description>
